# PHASE ORCHESTRATION & WORKFLOW STATE

> 6-phase execution with per-section RGV loops and micro-checkpoints.
> **Before starting:** READ `templates/documentation-style.yaml` and `examples/01_pricing_sync/` for format reference.
> **RGV Loop:** Defined in `@01_Guidance.mdc §1`. Each phase below specifies WHAT to read/generate — the HOW is always the RGV loop.

---

## WORKFLOW STATE MACHINE

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> P0: Start
    P0 --> P1: Inventory complete
    P1 --> P2: Flows documented
    P2 --> P3: Mappings documented
    P3 --> P4: Profiles & Functions documented
    P4 --> P5: Connectors documented
    P5 --> [*]: Zero data loss certified
```

---

## PHASE DEFINITIONS

| Phase | Name | RGV Per | Deliverable | Checkpoint |
|-------|------|---------|-------------|------------|
| 0 | Discovery & Planning | Each XML file | Sections 1-2, component-inventory.md | Component counts + reading plan |
| 1 | Flow Documentation | Each process | Section 3, shape-configuration.md | Shape counts per process |
| 2 | Mapping Documentation | Each map | Section 4 (ALL field mapping rows) | Mapping counts per map |
| 3 | Profile & Function Docs | Each profile/function | function-reference.md, profile-structures.md | Field/step counts |
| 4 | Connector & Cross-Ref Docs | Each connector/op/crossref | Section 5, connector-settings.md | Settings documented |
| 5 | Validation & Certification | Each XML file | Sections 6-7, verification-checklist.md | Zero data loss cert |

---

## PHASE 0: DISCOVERY & PLANNING

**Action:** READ each XML file directly, classify, count elements, build reading plan with counts.
**Purpose:** Classification and inventory ONLY. Content generation happens in later phases via RGV.

### Per XML File
1. READ file using Read tool
2. IDENTIFY type from `<bns:Component type="...">`
3. EXTRACT: componentId, name, type, version, description, element counts
4. RECORD in inventory with NUMERIC counts
5. BUILD reading plan with element counts per file (see below)

### Reading Plan with Counts (CRITICAL — Build During Phase 0)

```
Phase 1 needs:
  - process_1.xml (14 shapes)
  - process_2.xml (18 shapes)
Phase 2 needs per map:
  - map_1.xml (22 mappings) + source_profile.xml + target_profile.xml + function.xml
  - map_2.xml (161 mappings) + source_profile.xml + target_profile.xml
Phase 3 needs:
  - profile_1.xml (49 fields), profile_2.xml (23 fields)
  - function_1.xml (5 steps), function_2.xml (3 steps)
Phase 4 needs:
  - connector_1.xml, operation_1.xml, crossref_1.xml (7 rows)
Phase 5 needs: ALL files (re-read for verification)
```

### Component Detection

| XML Type | Category | Count Element | Key Attributes |
|----------|----------|---------------|----------------|
| `process` | Process | `<shape>` | allowSimultaneous, version |
| `transform.map` | Map | `<Mapping>` | optimizeExecutionOrder |
| `transform.function` | Function | `<Step>` | positions, cacheEnabled |
| `connector-settings` | Connector | - | All settings |
| `connector-action` | Operation | - | mode, batchSize |
| `crossref` | Cross Reference | `<Row>` | Columns + data |
| `profile.*` | Profile | `<DataElement>` | ALL fields, types |

### Flexible Input Location

Accept exports from any user-provided location (`@exports/uuid/`, `project/input_boomi/`, etc.).

### File Actions
1. EXTRACT `{flow_number}` from process name (e.g., `HNK_US_PRC_13020_...` → `13020`)
2. EXTRACT `{flow_name}` = number + short name (e.g., `13020_PRICE_LIST`)
3. `mkdir: project/output_boomi/{flow_number}/supporting-docs/`
4. CREATE: `boomi_design_{flow_name}.md` (Sections 1-2)
5. CREATE: `supporting-docs/component-inventory.md`
6. CREATE: `.boomi-state.json`

