## CHECKPOINT FORMATS

### Micro-Checkpoint (per section — Phases 1-4)
```
  ✅ 3.1: HNK_US_PRC_12730 — 18/18 shapes
  ✅ 4.1: HNK_US_MAP_JSON_XML — 22/22 mappings
  ✅ Profile: JSON_Response — 49/49 fields
  ✅ Function: UDF_ProductID — 3/3 steps
  ✅ CrossRef: XOMI_Lookup — 7/7 rows
```

### Phase Checkpoint (per phase)
```
╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ ✅ PHASE {n} COMPLETE: {Phase Name}                          │
├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ {Summary metrics with micro-checkpoint rollup}                │
│ 💾 State saved to .boomi-state.json                           │
│ → Proceeding automatically to Phase {n+1}...                  │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
```

**CRITICAL:** After EVERY phase checkpoint, UPDATE `.boomi-state.json` with:
- `current_phase` incremented
- Phase status set to `"done"`
- Micro-checkpoint counts recorded in `checkpoints` array

