## ERROR RECOVERY

| Situation | Action |
|-----------|--------|
| Missed attribute | RE-READ XML, extract missing (RGV step 5) |
| Count mismatch | STOP, RE-READ, find missing, fix before proceeding |
| Unknown type | Document with all attributes + ⚠️ flag |
| Stale context | RE-READ XML fresh — never generate from memory |

