## CONFIDENCE CALIBRATION

| Confidence | When to Use | Action |
|------------|------------|--------|
| **HIGH** | Clear XML structure, all elements present | Proceed with extraction |
| **MEDIUM** | Unusual XML structure, ambiguous elements | Flag assumptions, note in verification |
| **LOW** | Missing XML data, contradictory elements | **STOP** — flag as gap, document what IS present |
